# Frontend

[svg](https://github.com/EdBel0100/TelEstateProject0#frontend)

This is the frontend and it is powered by NextJs/React. The goal of the frontend is to provide landlords with an easy way to manage their properties, tenants and other information.

## Tech Stack

[svg](https://github.com/EdBel0100/TelEstateProject0#tech-stack)

* **NextJs & React** - Web application development
* **TypeScript** - Type safety and development
* **Tailwind CSS** - Styling and UI development

---

## BACKEND

[svg](https://github.com/EdBel0100/TelEstateProject0#backend)

The backend uses the MVC design pattern and uses

## TechStack

[svg](https://github.com/EdBel0100/TelEstateProject0#techstack)

* **NestJs** - The actual backend utilizing the MVC design pattern
* **Prisma** - Prisma is the object relational mapper allowing easy communication between the backend and the database
* **Postgres** - Postgres is the database

## Extra

[svg](https://github.com/EdBel0100/TelEstateProject0#extra)

* **Guards** - I used NestJs' guards to secure the backend and protect the different routes

---

## Infrastructures

[svg](https://github.com/EdBel0100/TelEstateProject0#infrastructures)

This part uses AWS CDK to build the infrastructures needed to host this project.
